.TH AVR\-FIREWALL\-EXPORT 1 "" "avr 0.8.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-firewall-export \- Export this scope's rules as portable JSON.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr firewall export
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export this scope's rules as portable JSON.
.PP
Export the selected scope in the same versioned JSON format as the console. Inherited rules and storage IDs are excluded. Use --file PATH, or redirect stdout.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-file\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output file, or - for stdout. Existing files are not overwritten. (default: -)
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug; defaults to the configured organization.
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository ID or owner/repo. If provided, uses repository scope.
.SH SEE ALSO
